                        <article class="gst-article-body">
                            <p class="gst-intro">Do business with Mouser in a way that best fits your needs. When you enter our site you will be prompted to select how you want to order from Mouser. Don’t worry, you can always change this selection in the cart.</p>
                            <section id="standard-invoice">
                                <h2>Standard Invoice</h2>
                                <p>Enjoy flexible payment options and FCA Incoterms with versatile shipping choices. Plus, you handle all duty and customs fees at delivery, ensuring a smooth and straightforward process.</p>
                                <p><u>Payment Options Include:</u></p>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Most major credit cards (Available in INR or USD)</li>
                                    <li>Net terms (USD only)</li>
                                    <li>Wire transfer/Proforma (USD only)</li>
                                </ul>
                                <p><u>Incoterms: Free Carrier (FCA)</u></p>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Flexible shipping options with most major carriers</li>
                                    <li>You assume all responsibility for duty and customs fees collected at time of delivery</li>
                                </ul>
                            </section>
                            <section id="gst-business-invoice">
                                <h2>GST Business Invoice (INR only)</h2>
                                <p>Must have valid GSTIN. Experience seamless transactions with INR billing, local support, cost efficiency, GST-compliant invoices, faster delivery, and minimal customs paperwork.</p>
                                <p><u>Payment Options Include:</u></p>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Net terms</li>
                                    <li>Wire transfer/Proforma</li>
                                </ul>
                                <p><u>Incoterms: Delivery Duty Paid (DDP)</u></p>
                                <ul>
                                    <li>Mouser Select Shipping</li>
                                    <li>Mouser pays customs and duties</li>
                                    <li>Orders must be billed and shipped to a business address in India</li>
                                </ul>
                            </section>
